  "query_preview": "..\n(Friday through Tuesday)\nIssued at 1255 AM CDT Wed Aug 12 2026\n\nThe western extension of the high pressure over the southeast US \nwill begin to build back into the south central states starting \nFriday and continue through the weekend. This will ultimately push\nthe chance for storms to the northwest portion of the area over \nthe weekend and then eventually the rain chances come to an end as\nwe start the new week. As the upper high become re-established \nover the area there will be a continuation of the hot weather with\ntemps in the upper 90s to low 100s across the area as we start \nthe new week.",
